        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-23T00:40:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just completed a game against Omnitron where the game was over with a Hero victory at the start of the fourth Villain turn.  It involved Visionary, Argent Adept, Legacy and Nightmist.  Between their capabilities, it was hilarious how much they did not care about Omnitron’s feared Electro-Pulse Explosives.  Each of them were capable of neutralizing it, if necessary.  Employing Wrest the Mind and a particular Nightmist trick, of course we elected to send it back Omnitron’s direction.  The game was sealed when he chose to play another.</p>\n<p>Most of my games against the Matriarch are very short - my last victory happened on the third hero’s turn of the fourth round.</p>\n<p>What are your shortest games, ending in either victory or defeat?  Storytime!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:49.964Z",
