        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-23T08:31:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>How do you manage to have short, victorious games against the Matriarch!?  My group and I find her to be frustrating mechanically and thematically, and just don’t have much fun against her in general.</p>\n<p>My group lost to Apostate in about three rounds in one of his earlier iterations.  Playtesters will surely know what I’m talking about with that guy!</p>",
