        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ea666f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-23T08:38:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>A combination of the right cards and the right heroes. For instance, twist the ether on the Matriarch, with anyone with damage type immunity (AZ, Ra, Legacy) tanking all of Matriarch’s damage (which is now cold / fire / whatever). But the Matriarch usually demolishes other hero combinations.<br>\nI’ve had a round 3 defeat with Akash’Bhuta. (A very unfortunate series of events)<br>\nI have a documented victory over Advanced Ennead where the Tefnut got KO’ed in the round 7 villain turn.</p>",
