        "raw": "[quote=\"\"Reckless\"\"]\n\nHow do you manage to have short, victorious games against the Matriarch!?  My group and I find her to be frustrating mechanically and thematically, and just don't have much fun against her in general.\n\n[/quote]\n\n\nThus far, I've found that you beat the Matriarch quickly, or you don't beat her.  That particular game was the result of McBehrer's Twist the Ether/Absolute Zero/Coolant Blast combo (TM), that harmlessly channeled 60 fire damage through AZ, then released it at the Matriarch.  It was kinda lucky that all the pieces came together so quickly.  \n\nI don't usually set her up, myself.",
