        "created_at": "2012-06-24T14:32:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My shortest game ever involved losing to the Matriarch at the beginning of the second round, back when Pike Industrial Complex had a card that reduced the maximum HP of all (or at least all non environment) targets by 1,  causing all current birds to die, and all upcoming birds to die, with the Mask causing a second wave of birds to die, followed then by a Darken the Sky.  There is almost no way to walk away from that.</p>",
